sequenceDiagram
    participant WarehouseStaff as Warehouse Staff
    participant WebApp as Web Application
    participant POAPI as Purchase Order API
    participant POSvc as Purchase Order Service
    participant InventorySvc as Inventory Service
    participant DB as Database

    WarehouseStaff->>WebApp: Receive Shipment against PO
    WebApp->>POAPI: POST /api/purchase-orders/{poId}/receive
    POAPI->>POSvc: receiveOrder(poId, receivedItems)
    POSvc->>DB: fetchPurchaseOrder(poId)
    DB-->>POSvc: purchaseOrder
    loop For each received item
        POSvc->>InventorySvc: addStock(productId, quantity)
        InventorySvc->>DB: updateStockLevel(productId)
        POSvc->>DB: updatePOLineReceivedQty(lineId, quantity)
    end
    POSvc->>DB: updatePOStatus(poId, "COMPLETED")
    POSvc-->>POAPI: orderReceived
    POAPI-->>WebApp: 200 OK
    WebApp-->>WarehouseStaff: Stock Updated
